            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SS44R5U32D-RN,  4\" x 4\"x 5/8\" Radius Residential Stainless Steel Hinge with Non Removable Pin</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage includes a pair of hinges (2), matching Stainless Steel flathead, Phillips Drive #10 x 1\" wood screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFitted with a high grade, rust resistant, Non-Removable Pin (NRP) stainless steel pin for security. Utilizes template screw hole pattern for use with wood or metal doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"300\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SS44R5U32D.gif?v=1704354552\" width=\"300\" height=\"281\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana SS44R5U32D-RN Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 4 Inch Residential Stainless Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Radius: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.085\" (Residential)</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin: NRP Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #10 x 1\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SS44R5U32D-RN-specification.pdf?v=1704262171\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana SS44R5U32D-RN Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold in Pairs (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
